  m_Name: Escape
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: The Escape
  description: 'After some time spent monitoring guards behaviors, patrols and shifts,
    you finally decide it is time to break out. At night you use a makeshift lockpick
    made of bones to open the cell, sneak around the block until you reach the hallway.
    This corridor has two door to the sides and one big door that seems to lead to
    freedom. '
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: Check left door before leaving
    outcomeText: You find yourself in a room full of guards, thankfully you managed
      to beat them before they could call for reinforcements. You find an item on
      one of the guards that could be of use to you. (-40% HP, + item)
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 40
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1134b85ee4556a469d2aec3aec096c8, type: 2}
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Check right door before leaving
    outcomeText: You find some items left by the guards int this room. Different
      tresures that can be worth something. (+200 gold)
    goldChange: 200
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: Leave
    outcomeText: The risk was too big to stick around more than necessary. You leave
      through the big door and leave into the night.
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
